repository-code: https://github.com/Cassandra-Brigham/topochange
abstract: >-
  Topographic change detection and uncertainty quantification
  using variogram-based methods. A Python library for comparing
  raster digital elevation models (DEMs) and point cloud data,
  performing coordinate reference system transformations,
  conducting variogram-based uncertainty analysis, and
  propagating regional uncertainty measurements.
keywords:
  - topography
  - DEM
  - uncertainty
  - variogram
  - geospatial
  - raster
  - point-cloud
  - change-detection
